B.SS=new A.ro("Browser privacy \u2014 Build 44\n\nThis browser version uses the local dictionary and bilingual search engine. After a complete initial online download, the cached dictionary can work offline. The website host receives ordinary page-request information such as an IP address.\n\nFavorites, notes, saved translations, corrections and preferences stay in this browser for this website origin. They are not synchronized to the Android app. Clearing website data or using private browsing may remove them. The app does not automatically upload those records.\n\nOnline translation is off by default. After consent, Mongolian search text, including partial searches and recognized words, may be sent to MyMemory / Translated. The provider receives your public IP address and normal request information. Do not send confidential information. API retention, reuse and downstream processing have not been verified. Turning the feature off cannot recall requests already sent.\n\nBoth English and Mongolian browser speech depend on browser speech support, may require internet, and may transmit audio to the browser speech provider. This web build does not run the Android offline Mongolian recognizer. Typed search remains available when speech is unsupported. Microphone permission is separate from online-translation consent. Saved corrections do not retrain the provider.\n\nPronunciation uses available browser/device voices. External source links require internet and follow their own websites' policies. Wi-Fi or mobile data is selected by your device settings; data charges may apply. The app has no account registration, advertising, analytics or in-app payment integration.\n\nOptional error reports are sent only when you press Send report. The selected term, entry ID, category, report language, build version, description and suggested correction pass through Vercel into the author\u2019s private GitHub repository. Vercel receives ordinary network information, including your IP address, for delivery and abuse protection. Do not include personal or confidential information. Reports are kept for review without a fixed deletion schedule; contact the author about deletion. Reports do not automatically modify the dictionary.\n\nPrivacy contact: illteachyoutoo@yahoo.com. The linked public native-app policy describes Android/iOS behavior; this browser notice describes this web build.",null)
